      guessed): Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authentication.JwtBearer 10.0.12,
      Microsoft.AspNetCore.OpenApi 10.0.12, Npgsql.EntityFrameworkCore.
      PostgreSQL 10.0.3, Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Tools 10.0.12
